          "number": 27,
          "unit_order": 27,
          "source_marker": "23",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Col&chapter=2&verse=23"
          ],
          "text": "ወኢ፡ ምሂከ፡ ሥጋ፡ አልቦቱ፡ ክብር፡ ምንተኒ። አላ፡ ውእቱ፡ ዘመልዕልተ፡ ሥጋ።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 3,
