          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Col&chapter=3&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ዘበእንቲኣሁ፡ ይመጽእ፡ መቅሠፍተ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ላዕለ፡ ውሉደ፡ ዐላውያን።"
        },
